Notes
-----
- Only the minimal set of icons currently required by Study-Agent is vendored
  (not the full Fluent repository).

- **Official Microsoft Fluent System Icons assets** (MIT, Microsoft Corporation),
  taken from the upstream repository above:
  `home`, `home_filled`, `book`, `book_filled`, `calendar`, `calendar_filled`,
  `settings`, `settings_filled`, `navigation`, `add`, `edit`, `delete`, `play`,
  `checkmark`, `warning`, `info`, `search`, `eye`.

- **Locally authored project assets** (drawn on the same 24px grid for this
  project, not copied from upstream):
  `chevron_left`, `chevron_right`, `more_horizontal`, `menu`, `eye_off`,
  `clipboard_task`.
  These are original Study-Agent assets and may be replaced with upstream
  Fluent assets if/when equivalent official SVGs are available.

- Icons are monochrome and tinted at runtime via semantic color tokens
  (see `app/ui/design/icons.py`), so there are no per-theme duplicates.
